  "description": {
   "en": "In a world where marriage between wizards and humans is allowed, Kagami Kippei (32), an elementary school teacher, and Lily (about 300 years old), a wizard, have recently gotten married! Although the pace of human and wizard life is sometimes a little different, they enjoy eating delicious meals together, making out on the couch, and making up as quickly as possible when they have small fights. This is a home love comedy with a blend of gentleness and a touch of fun!"
